    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mark Chrome and Safari's <code class=\"notranslate\">font-variant-position: sub</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">font-variant-position: super</code> as partially implemented, due to lack of font synthesis.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Most of the prior discussion is on <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2466203299\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24136\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24136/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24136\">#24136</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Vendor bugs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/352218916\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chromium 352218916</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=151471\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit 151471</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox does the right thing; see <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1024804\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gecko 1024804</a>.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #24136.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2466203299\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24136\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24136/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24136\">#24136</a> and <span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #20638.\">fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1874942852\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20638\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20638/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20638\">#20638</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Completes work started in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2471129783\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24152\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24152/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24152\">#24152</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See also:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2545989391\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24510\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24510/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24510\">#24510</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2543277276\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/748\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/748/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/748\">web-platform-tests/interop#748</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3390324981\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/1038\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/1038/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/1038\">web-platform-tests/interop#1038</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
